          %p
            The equations of motion on the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M5-brane"} M5-brane
            (the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/6d+%282%2C0%29-superconformal+QFT"} 6d (2,0)-superconformal QFT
            in a suitable limit) admits a
            = succeed "/" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/soliton"} soliton
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/black+brane"} black brane
            solution which is a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/string"} string
            charged under the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/self-dual+higher+gauge+field"} self-dual
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/B-field"} B-field
            \&amp;lbrack;
            %a{:href => "#HoweLambertWest97"}> Howe, Lambert &amp; West 1997, §3
            \&amp;rbrack;.
          %p
            Externally this is the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/boundary+field+theory"} boundary
            of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M2-brane"} M2-brane
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/brane+intersection"} ending
            on the
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M5-brane"} M5-brane
            = succeed "\u201D" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M-theory"} M-theory
            = succeed "." do
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M-string"} M-string
          %h2#properties Properties
          %h3#elliptic_genus_and_m5brane_charge Elliptic genus and M5-brane charge
          %p
            The
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/elliptic+genus"} elliptic genus
            of the self-dual string at the boundary of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M2-brane"} M2-brane
            on the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M5-brane"} M5-brane
            has been suggested to be directly analogous to the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Todd+genus"} Todd genus
            of the boundary of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/open+string"} open
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/superstring"} superstring
            ending on
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D-branes"} D-branes
            and hence has been suggested to be the
            %em
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M5-brane+charge"} M5-brane charge
            in
            = succeed "." do
              %a{:href => "#Sati10"} Sati 2010
            = succeed "." do
              %a{:href => "#HoheneggerIqbal13"} Hohenegger &amp; Iqbal 2013
          %h2#related_concepts Related concepts
