          %h2#references References
          %p
            The
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equations+of+motion"} equations of motion
            of the self-dual string as a solution of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D%3D6+supergravity"} D=6 supergravity
            was maybe first seen in
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Duff"}> Michael Duff
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jian+Xin+Lu"} Jian Xin Lu
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  Black and super
                  = succeed "-branes" do
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %mi p
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} p
              %strong 416
              (1994) 301-334 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9306052"}> arXiv:hep-th/9306052
              ,
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/0550-3213(94)90586-X"} doi:10.1016/0550-3213(94)90586-X
          %p
            The appearance of self-dual string in six dimensions with an
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/ADE+classification"} ADE classification
            was first observed in
          %ul
            %li#Witten95
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Edward+Witten"}> Edward Witten
              ,
              %em Some Comments On String Dynamics
              \&amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9507121"}> arXiv:hep-th/9507121
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            As a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/black+brane"} black brane
            (“soliton”) solution to the equations of motion on the
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M5-brane"} M5-brane
          %ul
            %li#HoweLambertWest97
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Paul+S.+Howe"}> Paul S. Howe
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Neil+Lambert"} Neil Lambert
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Peter+West"} Peter West
              = succeed "," do
                %em The Self-Dual String Soliton
              %strong 515
              (1998) 203-216 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9709014"}> arXiv:hep-th/9709014
              ,
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/S0550-3213(97)00750-5"} doi:10.1016/S0550-3213(97)00750-5
          %p
            As a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Green-Schwarz+sigma-model"} Green-Schwarz sigma-model
            the
            = succeed "-cocycle" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/brane+scan"} brane scan
          %ul
            %li#CastellaniDAuriaFre
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Leonardo+Castellani"}> Leonardo Castellani
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Riccardo+D%27Auria"} Riccardo D'Auria
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Pietro+Fr%C3%A9"} Pietro Fré
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Supergravity+and+Superstrings+-+A+Geometric+Perspective"} Supergravity and Superstrings - A Geometric Perspective
              %p
                (in
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D%27Auria-Fr%C3%A9+formulation+of+supergravity"} D'Auria-Fré formulation of supergravity
          %p
            As the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/brane+intersection"} brane intersection
            of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M2-branes"} M2-branes
            onto an
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M5-brane"} M5-brane
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Anirban+Basu"}> Anirban Basu
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jeffrey+A.+Harvey"} Jeffrey A. Harvey
              = succeed "," do
                %em The M2-M5 Brane System and a Generalized Nahm’s Equation
              %strong 713
              (2005) 136-150 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0412310"}> arXiv:hep-th/0412310
              ,
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.nuclphysb.2005.02.007"} doi:10.1016/j.nuclphysb.2005.02.007
          %p Further discussion:
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/John+Schwarz"}> John Schwarz
                ,
                %em Self-Dual Superstring in Six Dimensions
                \&amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9604171"}> arXiv:hep-th/9604171
                \&amp;rbrack;
            %li
              %p
                Vasilis Niarchos, Konstadinos Siampos,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Entropy of the self-dual string soliton
                %strong 2012
                134 (2012). &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1206.2935"}> arXiv:1206.2935
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/JHEP07(2012)134"} doi:10.1007/JHEP07(2012)134
            %li#Sati10
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hisham+Sati"}> Hisham Sati
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Geometric+and+topological+structures+related+to+M-branes"} Geometric and topological structures related to M-branes
                %strong 81
                (2010) 181-236 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1001.5020"}> arXiv:1001.5020
                \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            In view of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M-strings"} M-strings
            and the
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M-string+elliptic+genus"} M-string elliptic genus
          %ul
            %li#HoheneggerIqbal13
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Stefan+Hohenegger"}> Stefan Hohenegger
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Amer+Iqbal"} Amer Iqbal
              %em M-strings, Elliptic Genera and N=4 String Amplitudes
              \&amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1310.1325"}> arXiv:1310.1325
              \&amp;rbrack;
        .revisedby
